        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Trans-Karakoram Tract, Jammu and Kashmir\n- Topics: Shaksgam, Shaksgam River, Karakoram, Kunlun range\n\nFacts:\n- The Trans-Karakoram Tract is also known as Shaksgam or the Shaksgam Tract.\n- The Trans-Karakoram Tract is an area of more than 9,900 km² along both sides of the Shaksgam River and extends from the Karakoram to the Kunlun range.\n- Jammu and Kashmir is a state in northern India.\n- Jammu and Kashmir is often denoted by the acronym J&K.",
